    },
    {
      "title": "阳光很好…",
      "desc": "今天不该出门的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_weather_sunny_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/p9eoogxf2qqyi3iqct1h98l88g3wmw3.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "起风的时候…",
      "desc": "凉凉的，很舒服。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_weather_breezy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/eht6ld6osoiwg7htr6mq63mr7pjhaeo.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "刮大风了…",
      "desc": "拉手…拉手！要、要被吹跑了！…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_weather_gale_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/tf6xva7z36apzaj57rjl6femgrrwfr2.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "早上了吗？今天要做的是…我看看笔记。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/jie3svapkyc83lkr8q7ju0k85fvwmrh.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "…忘记帮白先生分拣药材了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/5nx2st58sskqzraa8a3026lrx7magki.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "晚上好。今天…我做了什么来着…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/l4ibhjaz6mgpl1v59ihajmqd4ir7cez.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "你先休息吧，我该去做柔软体操了…不要偷看。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/1vxvk4q1chseobq6o71de5bbwoixjjl.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于七七自己…",
      "desc": "你问我吗…？对不起，我不记得了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/al7ipz56jh3ajbscusyaotk22o2zpn5.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·记忆力",
      "desc": "很多事情我都记不起来了，但是…也没什么不好。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_close",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/4jpkds89vtr3qeyf5kp03m4gzcyw51v.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·记忆力锻炼",
      "desc": "最近我努力做了很多记忆力锻炼，所以不用担心我会忘记你了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/qb2s29b91imcgvtp9yl09q7xqvmwdj4.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "「神之眼」，虽然无法停住时间，但是给了我守护重要之人的力量。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/1erx3dqgjwwgr8z51fhhob1tjgd48iq.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "其实我的身体状况比白先生好很多…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_share",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/bafegaoxwxhmxfn68y8wutkw8vsx4tr.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "药庐附近有时候会有小团雀出没，小小的一团。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_pref_gift",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/1m378clazsp0wprv0tedvhrzl1v142g.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于白术…",
      "desc": "我记不起来白先生的脸了，但是也没什么关系…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_baizhu_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/78/l03cds6z7aosltejyz7ghtm7dlxx89t.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于胡桃…",
      "desc": "高温、假笑和死亡…讨厌。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_hutao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/78/im88gvsccqv1hzd9hov6dtucvkapjwu.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于魈·名字",
      "desc": "唔，听起来像老古董…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_xiao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/da/671lsoh3xrx92z6o2d1e3e9yghqprl9.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于魈·记忆",
      "desc": "我见过他吗…？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_xiao_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/70/30zxalipcbauxhizaqdulcudofadvuk.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于辛焱…",
      "desc": "…是谁？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_xinyan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/1gk5g3sdmuu0hdm2d4sdjtvr7f6pacw.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于瑶瑶…",
      "desc": "可爱…像小团雀。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_yaoyao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/c09kx0vcu6172pvl1tyafhea56rejqy.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于小冥…",
      "desc": "晚上…偶尔会感觉到有人和我一起做体操…是错觉吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_teammate_duskyMing_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/23vv14b49udvv7ska2jk31iq2fs7ka8.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解七七·其一",
      "desc": "有什么事吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/528b8tn3ezs9lwfm7lvfjqw9jnwe81e.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解七七·其二",
      "desc": "柔软体操，让我能够保持和人类一样的身体状态。但是如果放松下来的话，就会变回去…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/bma4d9bnl5lwyjxn1vt3cyc154i19ep.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解七七·其三",
      "desc": "有的人想要利用我，有的人很害怕我。但是你…和他们都不一样。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/3mq86c8lapn882vz9n2ofgl2gavssm3.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解七七·其四",
      "desc": "从第一次见面开始，你就给我一种很温暖的感觉。和让人不舒服的热不一样，是我的心，感觉到了温暖。谢谢你…我很高兴。可惜我只认识现在的你，如果以后我忘记了…我们就…不，我会「命令」自己记住你。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/6c26rhy5zxnla9xeiubwwvyezt8robd.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解七七·其五",
      "desc": "以前我只想要活下去，虽然不知道为了什么活下去…但现在我好像知道了，以后想要和你一起活下去。我、我们可以…永远一直在一起吗？啊…真的可以吗？嗯！我会保护好你的！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/b1bbm5ez21f2qdit6htjlsfhsc6j8o9.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "七七的爱好…",
      "desc": "想要一只小宠物…小团雀那样子的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/jhajbgcsydbe3ycd40bvixs90kplgzy.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "七七的烦恼…",
      "desc": "我不明白，但是，温度高会让身体很难受…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/b550qrtdxqbyjwk5ljy5bj7hehirao2.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "喜欢椰奶。但是…尝不出味道。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_pref_foodLike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/cpm0cj7taisnxqeojg5rhuhrz5uwqy2.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "对不起，我不知道…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/qeeaxow0nl7wzctoj90uf90f2pj1vp4.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "凉凉的，很喜欢。虽然没有味道…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/6vosx8bq3fv6ryydw91cq4utkzy6z6v.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "唔…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/o6uv2gt1hlpmbvaxru9jlw3t4z0605s.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "有点烫…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/cbgd16mx73rdfvxg2cnvfab7ubb0ikz.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "生辰快乐。给，草药香囊。很惊讶吗？上次你告诉我的时候，我就记在纸上了。每天都看一遍的话，今后也不会忘记的…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_pref_birthday",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/3rzkabhe62lkyvxcaw44go93kpo5gm0.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "啊，变强了吗…变强，是什么呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/i9etms6dy44z40c515rzplf3pb3o81l.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "啊，理解了。变强之后，控制力量需要更多的精力了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/ez04dxk60nfllyebb5qpmjx9j9xyytl.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "以前我对更加强大并没有概念，但是现在…我希望能够再强一点。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a8/oevq5nk34wlhtexwpxsbu7q2rnypkrt.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "这一切都是因为你在，谢谢你…可以答应我一个愿望吗？今后…就让我来保护你吧，好不好？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_qiqi/vo_qiqi_starUp_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/ed/VO_ZH_Qiqi_Feelings_About_Ascension_-_04.ogg"
    }
  ],
